<?xml version="1.0"?>
<alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2"><identifier>4cd25719-0f85-43f8-8aa7-8eb83f23e565</identifier><sender>PAGASA-DOST</sender><sent>2026-10-23T05:16:03+08:00</sent><status>Actual</status><msgType>Update</msgType><scope>Public</scope><references>PAGASA-DOST,c0e1085c-7ad8-4686-946e-76b132b175cc,2026-10-22T17:26:07+08:00</references><info><category>Met</category><event>General Flood Advisory (Final)</event><responseType>AllClear</responseType><urgency>Past</urgency><severity>Minor</severity><certainty>Unlikely</certainty><expires>2026-10-23T17:16:03+08:00</expires><senderName>PAGASA-DOST</senderName><headline>General Flood Advisory (Final)</headline><description>Under present weather conditions, At 3:00 AM today, the center of the eye of Typhoon "ROSAL" {CHAMPI} was estimated based on all available data at 280 km East Northeast of Itbayat, Batanes (22.0&#xB0;N, 124.2&#xB0;E) with maximum sustained winds of 155 km/h near the center and gustiness of up to 190 km/h. It is moving Northwestward at 15 km/h.  
The 12-hour rainfall forecast is Isolated light rains or thunderstorms.  
WATERCOURSES NO LONGER TO BE AFFECTED :  

 + **Ilocos Norte** - Rivers and its tributaries particularly Bulu, Banban, Bacarra-Vintar, Laoag and Quiaoit.  
</description><instruction>With this development and unless significant rain occurs, this is the final general flood advisory for this event.</instruction><web>http://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/index.php/26-hydromet/1582-flood-forecast-terms-and-symbols</web><contact>PAGASA-DOST</contact><parameter><valueName>layer:Google:Region:0.1</valueName><value>Region 1 (Ilocos Region)</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Ilocos Norte</areaDesc><polygon>18.579611337753,120.97239650866 18.447321817624,120.96087162877 17.971461724878,120.93175516319 17.826210510328,120.62497007269 17.701856694392,120.53671015583 17.898735531421,120.4449782564 18.084728674882,120.47256388267 18.320140726355,120.59567387022 18.492942504427,120.56599945684 18.530074148568,120.73337350922 18.64808013965,120.85649885388 18.579611337753,120.97239650866</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>012800000</value></geocode></area></info><Signature xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#"><SignedInfo><CanonicalizationMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/TR/2001/REC-xml-c14n-20010315"/><SignatureMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#rsa-sha1"/><Reference URI=""><Transforms><Transform Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#enveloped-signature"/></Transforms><DigestMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#sha1"/><DigestValue>qHZ1WNKOAyNl7dyjw3la6Z+AswU=</DigestValue></Reference></SignedInfo><SignatureValue>gghyZ2BXWm0a/Y+yKMgAxewIjRO76gQVTxtW/Bk+hMEJ+gyPLpeD9XiUvpljovvn
